  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><h2>About the Feature</h2><p>The CSV export feature is used to export concept data from Bahmni&nbsp;into a CSV file. This data can then be imported into another instance of Bahmni or used for analysis.</p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Used By</span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">This feature is predominantly used by hospital administrators and implementers.</span></p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">How is it Used?</span></h2><p>On the CSV export page you can enter a concept into the textfield and select one of the options from the dropdown.</p><p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:width=\"700\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image2016-4-15 12:42:6.png\" /></ac:image></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>CSV Export Screen</strong></p><p>After selecting the dropdown item, click the export button. This results in the download of a CSV file with the respective concept data.</p></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"6462b5e2-1d86-451d-a8c5-c39c2f99335c\"><ac:rich-text-body><p><strong style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>Bahmni configuration for each implementation can vary drastically. The screens and workflows may not be constant across all installations of Bahmni.</strong></span></strong></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Feature Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Data Migration - Import\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Import Data - Feature Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"3fe3feef-06ea-4aac-b9a1-a6bbe83b0bec\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Implemnentation Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Configure CSV Import\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Import Data - Implementer's Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
