    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"ExportData-AbouttheFeature\">About the Feature</h2><p>The CSV export feature is used to export concept data from Bahmni into a CSV file. This data can then be imported into another instance of Bahmni or used for analysis.</p><h2 id=\"ExportData-UsedBy\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Used By</span></h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">This feature is predominantly used by hospital administrators and implementers.</span></p><h2 id=\"ExportData-HowisitUsed?\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">How is it Used?</span></h2><p>On the CSV export page you can enter a concept into the textfield and select one of the options from the dropdown.</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/53313622/image2016-4-15%2012:42:6.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460704327642&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=159\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/53313622/image2016-4-15%2012:42:6.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460704327642&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53837857\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image2016-4-15 12:42:6.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"53313622\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\" data-media-id=\"5e53a707-9cc7-4d29-b369-307cc13df4ff\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/53313622/image2016-4-15%2012:42:6.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460704327642&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=318 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/53313622/image2016-4-15%2012:42:6.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460704327642&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=159 1x\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>CSV Export Screen</strong></p><p>After selecting the dropdown item, click the export button. This results in the download of a CSV file with the respective concept data.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"6462b5e2-1d86-451d-a8c5-c39c2f99335c\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p><strong style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><strong>Bahmni configuration for each implementation can vary drastically. The screens and workflows may not be constant across all installations of Bahmni.</strong></span></strong></p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/53313592/Data+Migration+-+Import\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53313592\" data-linked-resource-version=\"11\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Import Data - Feature Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"3fe3feef-06ea-4aac-b9a1-a6bbe83b0bec\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Implemnentation Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/18415806/Configure+CSV+Import\" data-linked-resource-id=\"18415806\" data-linked-resource-version=\"17\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Import Data - Implementer's Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
